        <mxCell id="stateDiagramV2-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Both end states are final: an unresolved emergency is NOT retried automatically.&lt;br/&gt;OxygenLeak: oxygen is deducted once on registerOccurrence() (entering handling) and once more in markUnresolved() - so an unresolved leak costs twice a repaired one. Habitat oxygen never goes below zero." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
