        <mxCell id="ucDiagramV2-53" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Colony Operator and Emergency Operator are the two human roles the task suggests; in the GUI they share one console.&lt;br/&gt;- Simulation Clock is the secondary actor that advances time on its own (the &quot;Auto-advance&quot; checkbox).&lt;br/&gt;- &quot;Generate colony status report&quot; is the live dashboard (resource bars, active mission, sim time) plus the activity feed; there is no separate printable report.&lt;br/&gt;- &quot;Start and execute mission&quot; is separate from &quot;Submit mission&quot;: submitting only reaches ASSIGNED." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
